=== blacksmith
@title The Blacksmith

~ give player sword 3
~ give player coin 5

The smith sets three old swords on the counter. Each has sharpness
{player:inventory:sword:sharpness}.

* [Pay five coins to sharpen one sword] { take player coin 5; player:inventory:sword:sharpness += 2 } -> forge
* [Keep your coins and leave] -> END

=== forge
@title A Sharper Blade

The smith returns one sword. Its sharpness is now
{player:inventory:sword:sharpness}; the other two remain unchanged.

~ player:inventory:sword:durability -= 10
{if player:inventory:sword:durability < 20}
Your blade is chipped.
{/if}

-> END
